OL,3,GNEWSA#27k business rates rise
OL,4,A'catastrophic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family-run campsite's business rates
OL,7,Fbill has increased by a "catastrophic"
OL,8,F2,700%.
OL,10,FJules Sayer owns the Petruth Paddocks
OL,11,Fcampsite in Cheddar, Somerset, where
OL,12,Fthe site's annual bill has increased
OL,13,Ffrom #1,070 to #28,820.
OL,15,FSayer said the new bill had caused him
OL,16,F"untold worry", adding: "What happens
OL,17,Fnext? I haven't got that [kind of
OL,18,Fmoney] sat around, most businesses
OL,19,Fdon't - they budget at the start of the
OL,20,Ffinancial year, not the end of it."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
