OL,3,GNEWSA#27k business rates rise
OL,4,A'catastrophic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnswering a question about the
OL,7,Fsituation in the House of Commons,
OL,8,Fbusiness secretary Jonathan Reynolds MP
OL,9,Fsaid the "obviously dramatic figures"
OL,10,Fmay "have happened through revaluation"
OL,11,Fand said he would put Sayer's local MP
OL,12,Fin touch with the Treasury.
